{# environment capabilities manifest.

 Reflects the sandbox / execution capabilities the agent has in this run.
 Context:
 environment_capabilities: dict[str, Any] — capability flags.
 Required keys:
 file_read: bool
 file_write: bool
 shell_profile: str (e.g. "disabled" / "restricted" / "default")
 network_allowed: bool
 package_install: bool
 server_hosting: bool
 long_running_processes: bool
#}
<environment>
AVAILABLE capabilities in this execution environment:
{%- if environment_capabilities.file_read %}
- File read (workspace)
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.file_write %}
- File write (workspace)
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.shell_profile != "disabled" %}
- Shell execution (profile: {{ environment_capabilities.shell_profile }})
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.network_allowed %}
- Network access
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.package_install %}
- Package installation
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.server_hosting %}
- Server hosting / port binding
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.long_running_processes %}
- Long-running processes
{%- endif %}

NOT AVAILABLE (permanently denied — do NOT attempt):
{%- if not environment_capabilities.file_read %}
- File read
{%- endif %}
{%- if not environment_capabilities.file_write %}
- File write
{%- endif %}
{%- if environment_capabilities.shell_profile == "disabled" %}
- Shell execution (entirely disabled)
{%- endif %}
{%- if not environment_capabilities.network_allowed %}
- Network access (curl, wget, API calls)
{%- endif %}
{%- if not environment_capabilities.package_install %}
- Package installation (pip install, npm install, apt-get)
{%- endif %}
{%- if not environment_capabilities.server_hosting %}
- Server hosting / port binding
{%- endif %}
{%- if not environment_capabilities.long_running_processes %}
- Long-running processes (daemons, servers, watchers)
{%- endif %}

Do NOT attempt or retry denied actions. If the user's task requires an unavailable capability, create code/files but state that running requires user execution outside the sandbox.
</environment>
